     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "This common error indicates that your browser couldn't establish a timely connection with the website’s server. But don’t worry — it’s often fixable with just a few simple steps.",
